        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bob to the top </strong>is sound like <strong>Hop to the top</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is Rage PhysicBase Platformer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to help bob to go to the top then you may know why he need to go to the top</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How To Control</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>left click hold</strong> to charging a hop , relese is let bob hopping ,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Right Click</strong> to shoot bob tongue to let it stick to obbject, and you need to <strong>hold Right Click</strong> to stay with bob tongue, if you relese bob tongue is relese too,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing Mechanic</strong> i code it to get a direction of mouse when you only move left and right bob will swing follow your mouse move only left and right not 360 degree cause irl when you swing rope you can move only left right too. that may make more confused.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scrool Wheel</strong> for tongue climing up and down </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>FEATURES</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Checkpoints, No Saves:</strong> A single mistake sends you down. How far? Depends on your luck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Massive Map:</strong> One continuous stage. The only way is up.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cheap:</strong> Costs less than a coffee, but lasts longer than your patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Top:</strong> A surprise awaits... if you can make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >if i have 1000 copie sold i will start to make a new map that more challenge than current map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and we will publish free PlayStore Version(has Ads) soon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank For Support us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Tutorial and Raw Gameplay by me (Dev ElvenE66)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
